clueweb09-en0006-30-06669.0 Help Put Remarkable Trees of Virginia into Virginia's public libraries! Help Put Remarkable Trees of Virginia into Virginia's public libraries! We want public libraries across Virginia to have a copy of Remarkable Trees in their collection. Thanks to a challenge grant from the Virginia 4-H Foundation and the Virginia Foundation for the Humanities we have 30 books that we can give to libraries, provided they are matched by a local gift. The concept is simple, purchase one book for a local public library, and we will send you one copy free of charge. When we reach 60 libraries, the offer ends! Libraries pledged to date: Central Baptist Academy Hampton University
clueweb09-en0006-30-06669.75 Help Put Remarkable Trees of Virginia into Virginia's public libraries! will send you one copy free of charge. When we reach 60 libraries, the offer ends! Libraries pledged to date: Central Baptist Academy Hampton University Museum Williamsburg Regional Library James City County Master Gardener Library Great Falls Library Sherwood Regional Library (Fairfax) Fairfax Regional Library Chesterfield Historical Society of Virginia Chesterfield County Public Library Sandston Elementary School Montgomery-Floyd Regional Library system (two copies) Pearisburg Public Library (Pearisburg) Iris Brammer Library (Narrows) Roanoke County Master Gardner Library Roanoke county Library System Charley P. Jones Memorial Library Clifton Forge Public Library [Remarkable Trees of Virginia Cover] [Virginia Foundation for the Humanities Logo]
