clueweb09-en0006-55-08119.0 Become a Friend of the Library - FCPL [Fairfax County, Virginia] [Fairfax County] Search Site: Home Living Here Doing Business Visiting Departments & Agencies [*] Become a Friend of the Library [*] homepage > library > about the library > become a friend of the library [*] Home Account Services Research Tools Catalog Databases Events Library Branches Good Reading About the Library Site Index Help enrich your community by becoming a Friend of the Fairfax County Public Library! [""]Library branches of the Fairfax County Public Library are aided by their Friends group. These individual groups support, assist and promote library activities for the local community. Every Friends group
clueweb09-en0006-55-08119.75 Become a Friend of the Library - FCPL County Public Library are aided by their Friends group. These individual groups support, assist and promote library activities for the local community. Every Friends group makes valuable contributions to the entire library, as well as their own branch. Friends activities vary depending on the needs of the individual community. Most Friends groups hold book sales, which help the library acquire books and equipment as well as sponsor programs and exhibits beyond the library's operating budget. You can become actively involved or simply have the satisfaction of supporting a worthwhile cause. Learn more about individual Friends groups and apply for membership
