clueweb09-en0006-55-07966.75 Martha Washington Library Will Close For Renovation December 20 -- FCPL Saturday, December 20 for renovation. The library will open in temporary quarters in mid-February 2009. Renovations to the branch are expected to take a minimum of 18 months. The temporary site for Martha Washington Library will be 6328 Richmond Highway, Unit F, Alexandria, VA 22306. While the Martha Washington Library is closed, customers can visit any of the nearby branches including Sherwood Regional Library at 2501 Sherwood Hall Lane in Alexandria, 703-765-3645; John Marshall Library at 6209 Rose Hill Drive in Alexandria, 703-971-0010; and Kingstowne Library at 6500 Lansdowne Centre in Alexandria, 703-339-4610. For directions or hours of operation. Edwin
